 "result": "I worked one app this run, pajamastan-warrants, and opened no pull requests.\n\nThe other five failing apps were skipped under the 3-day rule. Those were snapshot-engine-pied, topo-wars-server, field-twin-violet, tower-builder-five and termbeat. Each was already logged within the last three days with the same error. The topo-wars-server health pull request is still open and waiting on a merge.\n\nPajamastan-warrants is a Docker FastAPI backend with no vercel.json. Its code already serves the page at the root and has a status route. The 404 on its Vercel address therefore means the deploy is gone or unlinked, and I found no code fix.\n\nI logged it as needs decision. The developer has to redeploy it to a Docker host or point the Vercel name at a live host. I added notes on this to the shared notebook and pushed the fix log and notes to main.",
